<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19268" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βαλλάντιον</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bag, pouch, purse,</i> [<i><span class="en">
				Simon.
			</span></i>]<i><span class="en">
				178
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Epich.
				10
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βαλ-</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				707
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Char.</u>
				17.5
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παῖς ἐκ βαλλαντίου</span> a
			supposititious child, Telecl<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				41
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>javelin</i> (as if from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάλλω</span>), a pun in <i><span class="en">
				Dionys.
			</span></i> ap.<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				3.98d
			</span></i>. (The spelling <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βαλλ</span>-is better
			attested than that with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βαλ-,</span> cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1.354
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>, etc.; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βαλλαντιοτομέω,
			-τόμος.</span>)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
